{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**The problem.** Given an integer array `nums`, move all the **even** numbers to the front and all the **odd** numbers to the back. Any order within each group is fine. Return the array."
    },
    {
      "type": "drawing",
      "src": "/drawings/65f9726b-383c-4d91-aa7a-323338ab4214.svg",
      "alt": "3, 1, 2, 4 with i at the front on 3 and j at the back on 4. 3 is odd and 4 is even, both in the wrong half, so they swap: 4, 1, 2, 3. Then i stops on 1 and j on 2, they swap again, giving 4, 2, 1, 3: evens first, odds last.",
      "width": 729,
      "height": 467,
